# Covers JetBrains IDEs: IntelliJ, RubyMine, PhpStorm, AppCode, PyCharm, CLion, Android Studio and WebStorm
# Reference: https://intellij-support.jetbrains.com/hc/en-us/articles/206544839
# github actions
.git
.github/
.*ignore
# User-specific stuff
.idea/
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
# Environments
.env
.venv
env/
venv*/
ENV/
.conda/
# 本机特有的凭据/运行状态（.gitignore 已忽略）：Dockerfile 用 `COPY . /LKMBot/`，
# 不在这里挡掉就会连同开发者本地的 LLM/DB 配置与 cookie 一起烘进镜像层
# （docker history / 推送到 registry 都能看到）。运行期配置应走 env 或挂载。
configs/config.yaml
configs/session
cmd_config.json
cookies.json
logs/
CharacterModels/
GenieData/
data/
tests/
.ruff_cache/
.bot
.bot-tmp
bot.lock
dashboard/node_modules/
dashboard/src/assets/mdi-subset/
dashboard/public/vendor/
bot/dashboard/dist/
